flowchart TB
accTitle: Validate before shifting production traffic
accDescr: Tests and change review precede green deployment. Green health gates the traffic switch while the blue environment remains available for rollback.
A[Release artifact and template]:::inputData --> B[Automated tests in nonproduction]:::process
B --> C[Review CloudFormation change set]:::process
C --> D[Deploy green environment]:::process
D --> E{Health and release checks pass?}:::decision
E -->|No| F[Keep or restore traffic on blue]:::warning
E -->|Yes| G[Route traffic to green]:::process
G --> H{Rollback alarm?}:::decision
H -->|Yes| F
H -->|No, observation complete| I[Retire blue]:::output
